WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.156
Hazardous energy is any energy
that can move, heat, or hurt.

2
00:00:04.156 --> 00:00:06.857
Electrical energy in motors and panels.

3
00:00:06.857 --> 00:00:11.636
Mechanical energy in belts, blades,
and flywheels that keep spinning.

4
00:00:11.636 --> 00:00:16.970
Hydraulic and pneumatic energy trapped
under pressure in hoses and cylinders.

5
00:00:16.970 --> 00:00:18.702
Thermal energy and steam.

6
00:00:18.702 --> 00:00:20.572
Chemicals and gas in lines.

7
00:00:20.572 --> 00:00:23.966
And gravity, which can
drop a raised part on you.

8
00:00:23.966 --> 00:00:26.252
Most machines have more than one.

9
00:00:26.252 --> 00:00:30.824
Your placard lists every source,
and every one must be controlled.
